        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The demolitionist throws a pipe bomb at a point within 60 feet of it, where it explodes in a 10-foot-radius sphere. Each creature in the area must make a DC 18 Dexterity saving throw, taking 21 (6d6) piercing damage and 21 (6d6) thunder damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one. The pipe bomb deals double damage to objects, vehicles, and structures.</p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
